---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';

const allPosts = Object.values(import.meta.glob('./blog/*.md', { eager: true })) as any[];
const sortedPosts = allPosts.sort((a, b) => new Date(b.frontmatter.date).valueOf() - new Date(a.frontmatter.date).valueOf());
const recentPosts = sortedPosts.slice(0, 3);

const allProjects = Object.values(import.meta.glob('../projects/*.md', { eager: true })) as any[];
const sortedProjects = allProjects.sort((a, b) => a.frontmatter.order - b.frontmatter.order);
const featuredProjects = sortedProjects.slice(0, 2);
---

<MainLayout title="Amil's Portfolio">
  <section id="hero" class="section hero-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <h1>Hi, I'm <span class="highlight">Amil Ibrahimli</span></h1>
          <h2>Backend Developer & CS Student</h2>
          
          <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#projects" class="button1">
              <span class="button1__icon-wrapper">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 14 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="button1__icon-svg" width="10"><path d="M13.376 11.552l-.264-10.44-10.44-.24.024 2.28 6.96-.048L.2 12.56l1.488 1.488 9.432-9.432-.048 6.912 2.304.024z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>
                <svg viewBox="0 0 14 15" fill="none" width="10" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="button1__icon-svg button1__icon-svg--copy"><path d="M13.376 11.552l-.264-10.44-10.44-.24.024 2.28 6.96-.048L.2 12.56l1.488 1.488 9.432-9.432-.048 6.912 2.304.024z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>
              </span>
              View My Work
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image">
          <div class="profile-image-container">
            <div class="profile-image">
              <img src="/images/3x4.jpg" alt="Amil Ibrahimli" />
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about" class="section about-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>About Me</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-content">
        <div class="about-text">
          <p>
            Hi, I'm Amil. I am from Azerbaijan, Baku city. Right now I'm in the second year of my studies at Bilkent University, Computer Engineering department.
            Before coming to Bilkent, I gained real-world coding experience with Frontend Development. With just HTML, CSS, and JavaScript I've built several websites and sold them to customers.
            I think that it's important to mention that AI helped me a lot on building these projects because without it planning all stuff such as finding a suitable design, customizing it, communicating with the customer 
            to make it personalized, coding, testing, and deploying would be nightmare. But I should also mention that I don't like vibecoding (see: <a target="_blank" href="https://github.com/resources/articles/what-is-vibe-coding" style="color: #007AFF; text-decoration: underline;">vibe-coding</a>) as I believe it prevents us from actually learning the process.
            However, I like getting assistance from AI but writing the code manually. Below, you can find some of my projects.
          </p>
          <p>
            Here, at Bilkent, in <a target="_blank" href="https://catalog.bilkent.edu.tr/course/c11101.html" style="color: #007AFF; text-decoration: underline;">CS101</a> and <a target="_blank" href="https://catalog.bilkent.edu.tr/course/c11102.html" style="color: #007AFF; text-decoration: underline;">CS102</a> I had the chance of learning Java Core, OOP Principles, Exception Handling, GUI, Multithreading, etc. By the end of the semester we even built a project to demonstrate our skills. Below you will find that project too. Though I still haven't chosen my final career path yet, I believe that learning the Backend could be a good starting point to understand the system and then delve into the other fields of Computer Science.
            That's why I'm learning Spring Boot right now to be more autonomous on writing Backend apps. At the end of the year, I should have completed a summer internship (see: <a target="_blank" href="https://catalog.bilkent.edu.tr/course/c11299.html" style="color: #007AFF; text-decoration: underline;">CS299</a>) in a role that aligns with my degree. I plan to go with Backend Development roles, especially the ones where I can practice and improve my Spring Boot skills.
          </p>
          <p>
            Outside of the classes, I like to touch some grass (literally). I ride my bicycle regularly, except for the days when I get a flat tire from a thorn, and when it happens, fixing it also gives me stimulation and is kind of hobby to take care of my bike. And I go to the gym, except for the days I'm sick. I also used to pet 10 stray cats in Baku, our own home. As you can predict from the previous sentence, 
            I like interacting with animals and I had even volunteered at Baku Zoo before coming to the college for a month. Feel free to reach out me from navbar if you want to chat about programming, hackatons, startups, or just want to swap pictures of stray cats!
          </p>
          <div class="skills-container">
            <h3>Skills & Technologies</h3>
            <ul class="skills-list">
              <li>Java</li><li>C++</li><li>OOP</li><li>Multithreading</li>
              <li>Exception Handling</li><li>SQL</li><li>MySQL</li><li>Git</li>
              <li>GitHub</li><li>HTML</li><li>CSS</li><li>Bootstrap</li>
              <li>Tailwind CSS</li><li>JavaScript</li><li>Responsive Layout</li>
              <li>UI/UX Design</li><li>Figma</li><li>Canva</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="projects" class="section projects-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Featured Projects</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="projects-grid">
        {featuredProjects.map((project) => (
          <div class="project-card">
            <div class="project-image">
              <img src={project.frontmatter.image} alt={project.frontmatter.title} />
            </div>
            <div class="project-details">
              <h3>{project.frontmatter.title}</h3>
              <p>{project.frontmatter.description}</p>
              <div class="project-tech">
                {project.frontmatter.tech.map((t: string) => (
                  <span>{t}</span>
                ))}
              </div>
              <div class="project-links">
                <a href={project.frontmatter.github} class="button1 button1--static" target="_blank">
                  <span class="button1__icon-wrapper">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="button1__icon-svg" width="13" height="13">
                      <path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"></path>
                      <path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"></path>
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                  GitHub
                </a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <div class="view-more" style="margin-top: 2rem;">
        <a href="/projects" class="button1">
          <span class="button1__icon-wrapper">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 14 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="button1__icon-svg" width="10">
              <path d="M13.376 11.552l-.264-10.44-10.44-.24.024 2.28 6.96-.048L.2 12.56l1.488 1.488 9.432-9.432-.048 6.912 2.304.024z" fill="currentColor"></path>
            </svg>
            <svg viewBox="0 0 14 15" fill="none" width="10" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="button1__icon-svg button1__icon-svg--copy">
              <path d="M13.376 11.552l-.264-10.44-10.44-.24.024 2.28 6.96-.048L.2 12.56l1.488 1.488 9.432-9.432-.048 6.912 2.304.024z" fill="currentColor"></path>
            </svg>
          </span>
          View All Projects
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="recent-blogs" class="section about-section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Recent blog</h2>
        <div class="section-divider"></div>
      </div>
      
      <div style="margin-top: 64px;" class="blog-list-container">
        {recentPosts.map((post) => (
          <div class="blog-card-full">
            <h3 style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">{post.frontmatter.title}</h3>
            <p style="text-align: left;">{post.frontmatter.description}</p>
            <div class="project-tech" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
              <span>{post.frontmatter.category}</span>
              <span>{new Date(post.frontmatter.date).toLocaleDateString('az-AZ')}</span>
            </div>
            <div class="project-links">
              <a href={post.url} class="button1 button1--static" style="padding: 0.5rem 1rem;">
                <span class="button1__icon-wrapper" style="width: 20px; height: 20px;">
                  <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="button1__icon-svg" width="10" height="10">
                    <line x1="21" y1="6" x2="3" y2="6"></line>
                    <line x1="15" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"></line>
                    <line x1="17" y1="18" x2="3" y2="18"></line>
                  </svg>
                </span>
                Read Article
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      
      <div class="view-more" style="margin-top: 2rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
        <a href="/blog" class="button1">
          <span class="button1__icon-wrapper">
             <svg viewBox="0 0 14 15" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="button1__icon-svg" width="10"><path d="M13.376 11.552l-.264-10.44-10.44-.24.024 2.28 6.96-.048L.2 12.56l1.488 1.488 9.432-9.432-.048 6.912 2.304.024z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>
             <svg viewBox="0 0 14 15" fill="none" width="10" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="button1__icon-svg button1__icon-svg--copy"><path d="M13.376 11.552l-.264-10.44-10.44-.24.024 2.28 6.96-.048L.2 12.56l1.488 1.488 9.432-9.432-.048 6.912 2.304.024z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg>
          </span>
          View All Blogs
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</MainLayout>